{"id":"d868412e4c7fb403","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-model-completion-amalgamation.md","title":"Model Completion and Amalgamation","display":"thm-model-completion-amalgamation — Model Completion and Amalgamation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-model-completion-amalgamation","aliases":["17-thm-model-completion-amalgamation"],"display":"thm-model-completion-amalgamation — Model Completion and Amalgamation","depends_on":["[[17-df-model-companion]]","[[17-df-model-completion]]","[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]","[[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]]","[[17-df-diagram]]","[[17-df-theory-properties]]","[[17-thm-compactness]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive-label","source_section":"3.5","source_result":"Proposition 3.5.18","source_pages_print":[201,202],"source_pages_djvu":[217,218],"source_verification":"statement and both directions of diagram/amalgamation proof compared in supplied DjVu OCR; local extension to inconsistent theories disclosed","verification_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-model-completion-amalgamation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-model-completion-amalgamation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-model-completion-amalgamation — Model Completion and Amalgamation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f89b3dbb5152ec03\" href=\"?note=f89b3dbb5152ec03\" title=\"17-df-model-companion\">17-df-model-companion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"31695c838dded93c\" href=\"?note=31695c838dded93c\" title=\"17-df-model-completion\">17-df-model-completion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5b4c86c70dd29331\" href=\"?note=5b4c86c70dd29331\" title=\"17-df-embedding-amalgamation\">17-df-embedding-amalgamation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"abf539a1037d08d1\" href=\"?note=abf539a1037d08d1\" title=\"17-lem-universal-consequences-extension\">17-lem-universal-consequences-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"de1a11e45b1a5282\" href=\"?note=de1a11e45b1a5282\" title=\"17-thm-compactness\">17-thm-compactness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive-label"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.5"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Proposition 3.5.18"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>201</span><span>202</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement and both directions of diagram/amalgamation proof compared in supplied DjVu OCR; local extension to inconsistent theories disclosed"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f89b3dbb5152ec03\" href=\"?note=f89b3dbb5152ec03\" title=\"17-df-model-companion\">17-df-model-companion</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"31695c838dded93c\" href=\"?note=31695c838dded93c\" title=\"17-df-model-completion\">17-df-model-completion</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5b4c86c70dd29331\" href=\"?note=5b4c86c70dd29331\" title=\"17-df-embedding-amalgamation\">17-df-embedding-amalgamation</a> 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a> 的扩张语言实例；使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"abf539a1037d08d1\" href=\"?note=abf539a1037d08d1\" title=\"17-lem-universal-consequences-extension\">17-lem-universal-consequences-extension</a> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"de1a11e45b1a5282\" href=\"?note=de1a11e45b1a5282\" title=\"17-thm-compactness\">17-thm-compactness</a> 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)\n\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L(T^*,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)\n\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L(T^*,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 3.5.18，印刷 pp.201–202、DjVu 217–218，陈述和两个方向的证明均已对照 OCR。</p>\n<p>正向：把待合并的两模型延拓为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^*\">\\(T^*\\)</span> 的模型，并按共同底模型的名字扩张。它们满足同一个完全的图示理论，故可初等嵌入一个共同模型且名字一致。再延拓为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的模型即得原理论内的普通合并。</p>\n<p>反向：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^*\\cup\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(T^*\\cup\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 的任意两模型，先分别延拓为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的模型，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 内沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 合并，再延拓为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^*\">\\(T^*\\)</span> 的模型。起初两模型到最后模型的嵌入由模型完全性变为初等嵌入，且保持全部名字，故带名字的两个模型初等等价。可满足性由共全称后承保证，因而图示理论完全。</p>\n<p>上述联合嵌入事实使用同一完全理论的两个模型的初等图示，并对新增名字采用互斥标记。任一有限片段的两组带名字公式各自存在闭合后都是该完全理论的后承，故可在同一个模型中同时选择各组见证；共享的原语言名字始终固定。紧致性给出两个完整初等图示的共同模型。因此不需要假定共同图示底模型本身初等嵌入两边。</p>\n<p>一致性约定：原书印刷 p.186（DjVu 202）的模型完全性定义限于一致理论；本条沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"59d623a1692279f1\" href=\"?note=59d623a1692279f1\" title=\"17-df-model-completeness\">17-df-model-completeness</a> 的本地谓词，保留不一致时的空真延拓。故来源对应在一致理论上按原书理解；不一致边界由模型类为空另行核对，不把该延拓冒称原书定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model-companion","status":"resolved","id":"f89b3dbb5152ec03","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model-companion]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-completion","status":"resolved","id":"31695c838dded93c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model-completion]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-embedding-amalgamation","status":"resolved","id":"5b4c86c70dd29331","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-lem-universal-consequences-extension","status":"resolved","id":"abf539a1037d08d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-diagram]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"de1a11e45b1a5282","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-thm-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-companion","status":"resolved","id":"f89b3dbb5152ec03","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$ 使用 [[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]] 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 [[17-df-diagram]]、[[17-df-theory-properties]] 的扩张语言实例；使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-completion","status":"resolved","id":"31695c838dded93c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$ 使用 [[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]] 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 [[17-df-diagram]]、[[17-df-theory-properties]] 的扩张语言实例；使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-embedding-amalgamation","status":"resolved","id":"5b4c86c70dd29331","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$ 使用 [[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]] 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 [[17-df-diagram]]、[[17-df-theory-properties]] 的扩张语言实例；使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$ 使用 [[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]] 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 [[17-df-diagram]]、[[17-df-theory-properties]] 的扩张语言实例；使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$ 使用 [[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]] 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 [[17-df-diagram]]、[[17-df-theory-properties]] 的扩张语言实例；使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。","embed":false},{"target":"17-lem-universal-consequences-extension","status":"resolved","id":"abf539a1037d08d1","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$ 使用 [[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]] 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 [[17-df-diagram]]、[[17-df-theory-properties]] 的扩张语言实例；使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。","embed":false},{"target":"17-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"de1a11e45b1a5282","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$ 使用 [[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]] 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 [[17-df-diagram]]、[[17-df-theory-properties]] 的扩张语言实例；使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"一致性约定：原书印刷 p.186（DjVu 202）的模型完全性定义限于一致理论；本条沿用 [[17-df-model-completeness]] 的本地谓词，保留不一致时的空真延拓。故来源对应在一致理论上按原书理解；不一致边界由模型类为空另行核对，不把该延拓冒称原书定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)\n\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L(T^*,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T^*","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T^*\\cup\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"T^*","display":false}],"bytes":3254,"backlinks":[{"id":"15698750acc82ec9","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"第一等价由 $T$ 与 $T_\\forall$ 共全称后承及 [[17-thm-model-completion-amalgamation]] 得到。第二等价的正向利用生成子结构的图示完全性：两个元组有相同无量词类型时，其生成子结构同构，因而全类型相同；紧致性把全部无量词后承缩为一个有限合取。反向在加入任意一族名字后沿用量词消去；两个满足同一图示的模型满足相同无量词句，故满足相同全部句。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-199","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-equivalents]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-ultraproduct-form]]\n[[17-thm-completeness-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-countable-back-and-forth]]\n[[17-thm-countable-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language]]\n[[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]\n[[17-thm-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-thm-ehrenfeucht-mostowski]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-chain-union]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-erdos-rado]]\n[[17-thm-existential-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-finite-ramsey]]\n[[17-thm-fraisse-limit]]\n[[17-thm-horn-axiomatization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-reduced-products]]\n[[17-thm-horn-theory-reduced-products]]\n[[17-thm-isomorphic-ultrapowers]]\n[[17-thm-keisler-shelah]]\n[[17-thm-keisler-shelah-predicate-form]]\n[[17-thm-lindstrom]]\n[[17-thm-los]]\n[[17-thm-los-quotient-form]]\n[[17-thm-los-vaught]]\n[[17-thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski]]\n[[17-thm-model-companion-uniqueness]]\n[[17-thm-model-completeness-existential-test]]\